<title>USA: TSI Fingerson retires as chief executive.</title>
<headline>TSI Fingerson retires as chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI Inc said Friday that Leroy Fingerson, 65, chairman and chief executive, has retired as chief executive and that James Doubles, president and chief operating officer, has added the  chief executive officer post.</p>
<p>Dr. Fingerson, a TSI founder, will continue as chairman and half-time consultant to the company.</p>
</text>
